"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
3078,"Narrated to us Ahmad ibn Manṣūr al-Ramādī: narrated to us ʿAbd al-Razzāq: informed me Maʿmar: from al-Zuhrī: from Ibn al-Musayyib: from Abū Hurayrah, regarding the statement of Allāh, the Exalted: *""A declaration of immunity from Allāh and His Messenger""* (Qurʾān 9:1), who said:
*""When the Prophet (ﷺ) returned from Ḥunayn, he performed ʿumrah from al-Jiʿrānah. Then he appointed Abū Bakr (RA) to lead that Hajj.""*

**CHAPTER:**"
